    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n38354" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">prĭorsum</span></b>  and <b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">prĭorsus</span></b> , adv.
